        "ja": "それぞれの仕事",
        "en": "Their separate work"
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": "かつて、この港から十機が、それぞれの現場へ向かった。今もどこかで、自分の仕事を守っている。これは、港に残る昔の記録。",
        "en": "Long ago, ten machines left this harbour for their separate assignments. Each still kept its work somewhere in the world. This was a record of those earlier days."
      },
