      "title": {
        "ja": "待ち続けた中枢",
        "en": "The waiting core"
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": "アークハート。大分断の日、二次事故を防ぐため、全路線へ緊急停止を送った古い保全中枢。その判断は、あの日には必要だった。",
        "en": "Archeart: the old preservation core. On the day of the Great Divide it stopped every line to prevent further accidents. That decision had been necessary then."
      },
