      "movie": "epilogue",
      "scene": "E02",
      "title": {
        "ja": "十の空欄",
        "en": "Ten empty entries"
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": "停止の後にも、返事は送られていた。届かなかっただけだった。十の空欄を埋めていた「未帰還」の信号が、いま、一つずつ消えていく。",
        "en": "Replies had been sent after the stop. They simply had not arrived. Now the ten signals marked “not returned” were going dark, one by one."
      },
