      "scene": "E02",
      "title": {
        "ja": "帰ってきた十機",
        "en": "The ten who returned"
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": "港を守ったガン。道を開いた仲間たち。待たれていた十機は、この旅をしてきた自分たちだった。",
        "en": "Gun, who had held the harbour. The companions who had reopened the roads. The ten machines being waited for were the very ones who had made this journey."
      },
