        "en": "We are home"
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": "十機目の帰還確認が灯る。「おかえり。」ガンは、ようやく返事を届けた。「ただいま。みんな、帰ってきたよ。」",
        "en": "The tenth return confirmation lit up. “Welcome home.” At last Gun delivered the reply. “We are home. Everyone has returned.”"
