        "ja": "役目を終えた光",
        "en": "A light at rest"
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": "現地の安全記録と帰還がそろった。停止の権限を各地へ返し、アークハートは役目を終える。コアの光が、静かに落ち着いていった。",
        "en": "The safety records and return confirmations were complete. Archeart returned authority to the local lines. Its task was finished. The core’s light gently settled into rest."
