        "en": "The road ahead"
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": "アークラインは、もう一度動き出した。ひとつの旅が終わっても、暮らしと便りは続いていく。大地のどこまでも、想いは届く。",
        "en": "ARCLINE was moving once more. One journey had ended, but everyday life and letters would continue. Across the whole land, there was a way for them to arrive."
